    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald O'Donovan are delighted to present No. 24 Dromdiah Park to the market. This exceptional three bedroom end of terrace home extends to approximately 108 sqm (1,163 sq.ft.) and enjoys a superb position overlooking a beautifully maintained green area within this popular development.\n\nPresented in true turnkey condition, the property has been finished and maintained to an exceptionally high standard throughout. Tastefully decorated with a modern, timeless style, every room has been carefully designed to create a warm and inviting home.\n\nThe bright and spacious accommodation includes a welcoming entrance hall, W.C., a comfortable living room, utility and a superb open plan kitchen and dining area with double doors opening onto the private rear garden. Upstairs there are three generous bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, together with a stylish family bathroom.\n\nOutside, the rear garden offers a private, low maintenance space complete with a large timber shed providing excellent storage.\n\nWith an A-rated BER, this home offers excellent energy efficiency and year-round comfort. Located within walking distance of Killeagh village and its excellent range of amenities, with Midleton, Youghal and Cork City all within easy reach, this is an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers or families alike."
      },
      {
